{"id":"level-up-2026-10-24","name":"2026-10-24 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1801","en":"Shared rules govern behaviour in the communal workshop.","zh":"共同的规则规范着公共工作坊内的行为。","note":"govern · 统治， 管理； 控制， 支配 · govern behaviour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1802","en":"The spacious room easily accommodated all twenty workshop participants.","zh":"这间宽敞的房间轻松容纳了工作坊的全部二十名参与者。","note":"spacious · 宽广的， 宽敞的 · a spacious room","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1803","en":"We will analyse the results after collecting all the questionnaires.","zh":"收齐全部问卷后，我们将分析结果。","note":"analyse · 分析； 分解 · analyse the results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1804","en":"The new building closely resembles the original railway station.","zh":"新建筑与原来的火车站十分相似。","note":"resemble · 与…相似， 像 · closely resemble","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1805","en":"The school cafeteria serves hot meals until two o'clock.","zh":"学校食堂供应热餐到两点。","note":"cafeteria · 自助餐馆； 自助食堂 · a school cafeteria","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1806","en":"The narrow road leads to a remote village in the mountains.","zh":"这条狭窄的公路通向山里一个偏远的村庄。","note":"remote · 远的， 长久的； 遥远的， 偏僻的； 远程的； 关系疏远的， 脱离的； 绝少的， 微乎其微的； 孤高的， 冷淡的 · a remote village","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1807","en":"A minor hiccup with the projector delayed the presentation.","zh":"投影仪出了点小故障，推迟了展示。","note":"hiccup · 打嗝；嗝，呃逆；暂时困难 · a minor hiccup","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1808","en":"Persistent water shortages continue to afflict the small farming community.","zh":"持续缺水仍然困扰着这个小型农业社区。","note":"afflict · 使苦恼； 折磨 · afflict a community","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1809","en":"Ticket prices fluctuate widely depending on the time of year.","zh":"票价会随一年中的不同时段大幅波动。","note":"fluctuate · 涨落， 起伏； 变化 · fluctuate widely","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1810","en":"We need to calculate the total cost before ordering materials.","zh":"订购材料之前，我们需要算出总费用。","note":"calculate · 计算， 推算； 估计， 推测； 计划， 打算 · calculate the cost","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1811","en":"The ingredient list includes monosodium glutamate and several dried spices.","zh":"配料表中列有谷氨酸钠和几种干香料。","note":"glutamate · 谷氨酸； 谷酸盐 · monosodium glutamate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1812","en":"Applicants should possess basic computer skills and clear handwriting.","zh":"申请人应当具备基本电脑技能，字迹清晰。","note":"possess · 具有； 拥有 · possess a skill","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1813","en":"We painted the walls a neutral colour to suit different exhibitions.","zh":"我们把墙刷成了中性色，以适应不同展览。","note":"neutral · 中立的； 无明显特性的 · a neutral colour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1814","en":"Photography is an optional module in the first year.","zh":"摄影是第一学年的一门选修课程。","note":"optional · 可选择的， 非强制的， 随意的 · an optional module","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1815","en":"A detailed analysis of the figures revealed several unusual patterns.","zh":"对数字的详细分析揭示了几种异常规律。","note":"analysis · 分析； 分解 · detailed analysis","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1816","en":"The students worked together to devise a practical recycling plan.","zh":"学生们合作设计了一项切实可行的回收计划。","note":"devise · 设计， 发明 · devise a plan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1817","en":"The scale of the damage became apparent in daylight.","zh":"到了白天，损坏的严重程度显现出来。","note":"apparent · 显然的； 表面上的 · become apparent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1818","en":"A local journalist interviewed the volunteers about their restoration work.","zh":"一位当地记者采访了志愿者，了解他们的修复工作。","note":"journalist · 新闻工作者， 新闻记者 · a local journalist","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1819","en":"The study found a strong correlation between rainfall and river levels.","zh":"这项研究发现，降雨量与河流水位高度相关。","note":"correlation · 相互关系， 相关 · a strong correlation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1820","en":"Prolonged exposure to sunlight caused the old photographs to fade.","zh":"长时间暴露在阳光下使老照片褪色了。","note":"exposure · 暴露； 显露； 接触； 曝光 · exposure to sunlight","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1821","en":"He slowly released the clutch as the car moved uphill.","zh":"汽车往坡上行驶时，他慢慢松开了离合器。","note":"clutch · 离合器； · release the clutch","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1822","en":"Staff practised how to evacuate the building during a drill.","zh":"员工在演练中练习了如何撤离大楼。","note":"evacuate · 疏散； 撤离 · evacuate a building","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1823","en":"The externally funded project allowed students to join the research team.","zh":"这个由外部资助的项目让学生得以加入研究团队。","note":"externally · 外表上， 外形上 · externally funded","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1824","en":"In the darkness, I had to grope for the door handle.","zh":"黑暗中，我不得不摸索着寻找门把手。","note":"grope · 摸索 · grope for","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1825","en":"Despite winning several awards, she remained humble about her achievements.","zh":"虽然获得了几个奖项，她对自己的成就仍然保持谦逊。","note":"humble · 谦逊的，谦虚的；地位低下的，卑贱的；简陋的，低劣的；使谦恭； 使卑下； 贬低 · remain humble","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1826","en":"Our delayed flight meant arriving well after the hotel reception closed.","zh":"航班延误意味着我们到达时，酒店前台早已关门。","note":"flight · 航班 · a delayed flight","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1827","en":"The fishing boats returned to the sheltered harbour before the storm.","zh":"暴风雨来临前，渔船回到了避风港。","note":"harbour · 停泊； 隐匿；港湾 · a sheltered harbour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1828","en":"Fresh water became a valuable commodity during the prolonged drought.","zh":"长期干旱期间，淡水成了宝贵的商品。","note":"commodity · 商品， 货物； 日用品 · a valuable commodity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1829","en":"You can leave your coat in the cloakroom downstairs.","zh":"你可以把外套放在楼下的衣帽间。","note":"cloakroom · 衣帽间； 〈英〉洗手间 · leave in the cloakroom","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1830","en":"The final assignment requires students to conduct independent research.","zh":"最后一项作业要求学生开展独立研究。","note":"independent · 独立的，自主的，不受约束的；中立派， 无党派议员 · independent research","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1831","en":"The sea wall forms a vital line of defence against flooding.","zh":"这道海堤构成抵御洪水的重要防线。","note":"defence · 防御，保护；辩护；答辩； · a line of defence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1832","en":"The photographs were printed on thick, glossy paper.","zh":"这些照片印在厚实的光面纸上。","note":"glossy · 有光泽的， 光滑的 · glossy paper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1833","en":"The company will prefabricate the wall panels at its factory.","zh":"公司将在工厂预制墙板。","note":"prefabricate · 预制构件 · prefabricate components","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1834","en":"The technician offered a plausible explanation for the strange noise.","zh":"技术人员为这种奇怪的噪声提出了一个似乎合理的解释。","note":"plausible · 似有道理的， 貌似真实的； 嘴巧的 · a plausible explanation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1835","en":"Years of practice gave her mastery of traditional carving techniques.","zh":"多年的练习让她精通了传统雕刻技法。","note":"mastery · 精通， 熟练； 控制 · mastery of a skill","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1836","en":"Music made the mundane tasks of sorting files more enjoyable.","zh":"音乐让整理文件这样平淡的工作变得更有趣。","note":"mundane · 世界的； 世俗的， 现世的； 平淡的 · mundane tasks","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1837","en":"The novel explores the insidious effects of constant social pressure.","zh":"这部小说探讨了持续社会压力潜移默化的不良影响。","note":"insidious · 潜伏的， 隐伏的 · an insidious effect","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1838","en":"After a busy week, we enjoyed a slothful afternoon on the sofa.","zh":"忙碌一周后，我们享受了一个窝在沙发上的慵懒下午。","note":"slothful · 怠惰的， 懒惰的； 迟钝的 · a slothful afternoon","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1839","en":"The map shows several island groups near the equator.","zh":"地图标出了赤道附近的几个岛群。","note":"equator · 赤道 · near the equator","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1840","en":"Losing both lead researchers would seriously incapacitate the small team.","zh":"同时失去两位首席研究人员，将严重削弱这个小团队的工作能力。","note":"incapacitate · 使无能力； 使伤残； 使不适合； 使无资格 · incapacitate a team","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1841","en":"The newspaper headline caught my attention as I passed the shop.","zh":"经过商店时，报纸的标题引起了我的注意。","note":"headline · 大字标题； · a newspaper headline","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1842","en":"She travelled to London to attend an audition for the orchestra.","zh":"她前往伦敦参加了管弦乐团的试奏。","note":"audition · 试演； 试听， 试音 · attend an audition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1843","en":"Please sharpen your pencil before beginning the detailed sketch.","zh":"开始画精细的素描之前，请先削好铅笔。","note":"sharpen · 削尖， 磨快； 使敏锐， 使敏捷 · sharpen a pencil","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1844","en":"The planning committee met to discuss the proposed footbridge.","zh":"规划委员会开会讨论了拟议中的人行桥。","note":"committee · 委员会， 全体委员 · a planning committee","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1845","en":"The seminar examined how some advertisements objectify the people they portray.","zh":"研讨会探讨了某些广告如何物化其描绘的人物。","note":"objectify · 使客观化； 使具体化； 物化 · objectify people","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1846","en":"The student union organised a welcome event for international students.","zh":"学生会为国际学生组织了一场欢迎活动。","note":"union · 协会， 工会， 同盟； 联合， 合并 · a student union","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1847","en":"Archaeologists hope to excavate the site before construction begins.","zh":"考古学家希望在施工开始前发掘这个遗址。","note":"excavate · 挖掘， 开凿 · excavate a site","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1848","en":"There is a subtle difference between the two musical performances.","zh":"这两场音乐表演之间有细微的差别。","note":"subtle · 细微的， 微妙的， 难以捉摸的； 隐约的； 精巧的， 巧妙的； 诡秘的， 狡诈的 · a subtle difference","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1849","en":"The battery is an essential component of the portable recorder.","zh":"电池是这台便携式录音机的重要部件。","note":"component · 成分； · an essential component","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:s1850","en":"Students will conduct fieldwork along the river next month.","zh":"学生们下个月将沿河进行实地调查。","note":"fieldwork · 实地调查， 野外考察 · conduct fieldwork","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:w1801","en":"govern","zh":"统治， 管理； 控制， 支配","note":"英 /'gʌvn/ · 美 /'ɡʌvɚn/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1801-uk-9c9ebf94c3c2.mp3","text":"govern"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1801-us-82ae31373cf4.mp3","text":"govern"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:w1802","en":"spacious","zh":"宽广的， 宽敞的","note":"英 /'speɪʃəs/ · 美 /'speʃəs/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1802-uk-c0384692eb67.mp3","text":"spacious"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1802-us-d8216bb3a539.mp3","text":"spacious"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-24:w1803","en":"analyse","zh":"分析； 分解","note":"英 /'ænəlaɪz/ · 美 /'æn(ə)laɪz/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b8